WEBVTT

00:14:29.389 --> 00:14:32.423
Stanovnici Oklahome odlaze u Kaliforniju

00:14:32.423 --> 00:14:34.866
u velikim brojevima u potrazi 
za boljom budućnosti.

00:14:34.866 --> 00:14:36.655
Promatrajući ove demografske promjene

00:14:36.655 --> 00:14:37.815
doseljavanja sa zapada,

00:14:37.815 --> 00:14:39.443
čini se da sada imamo

00:14:39.443 --> 00:14:42.291
"gnjevne plodove".

00:14:42.291 --> 00:14:44.104
(Smijeh)

00:14:44.104 --> 00:14:47.169
(Pljesak)

00:14:47.169 --> 00:14:51.714
Unuci se vraćaju kući.

00:14:51.714 --> 00:14:53.502
Bili ste odlična i pažljiva publika.

00:14:53.502 --> 00:14:55.953
Puno vam hvala što ste me pozvali ovdje.

00:14:55.953 --> 00:14:58.496
(Pljesak)